      "expected_jsonld_status": "OK",
      "expect_conflict": false,
      "note": "Main price 3,99 EUR in the price module; JSON-LD Product/Offer carries 3.99 EUR. Related-product cards elsewhere on the page show 3 and 4 EUR, which is why the DOM channel is flagged MULTIPLE_DISTINCT."
